  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a 2026-11-05 official statement, Associate Deputy Attorney General Stephen Weiss said the creation of the DOJ-SITF marks an important moment to help advance SI technologies while protecting American innovation. Weiss also said the Department has a responsibility to use law enforcement tools to deter improper use of SI, harden regular reporting on SI risk and response, and ensure companies exercise vigorous internal controls so SI technology behaves as intended. He stated that the Department is committed to protecting all Americans and U.S. business interests.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In a 2026-11-05 official statement, Associate Deputy Attorney General Stephen Weiss said the creation of the DOJ-SITF marks an important moment to help advance SI technologies while protecting American innovation.",
