   "url": "https://www.justice.gov/opa/pr/department-justice-launches-super-intelligence-task-force",
   "text": "The creation of the DOJ-SITF marks an important moment for the Department to help advance SI technologies and, at the same time, protect American innovation,\" said Associate Deputy Attorney General Stephen Weiss. \"The Department also has a responsibility to utilize law enforcement tools at our disposal to deter improper use of SI, harden regular reporting on SI risk and response, and ensure companies exercise vigorous internal controls so that SI technology behaves as intended.",
